---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About CapitalColumn"
  description="Learn about CapitalColumn — how we use AI-powered analysis with editorial oversight to deliver trustworthy, source-linked financial news."
>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="static-page">
      <header class="static-page-header">
        <h1>About CapitalColumn</h1>
        <p class="static-page-lead">
          AI-powered financial intelligence, grounded in primary sources and editorial integrity.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="static-section">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          CapitalColumn brings AI-powered intelligence to financial news. We combine advanced language
          models with rigorous source verification to deliver accurate, timely market coverage — free
          from hype, spin, and speculation.
        </p>
        <p>
          In a landscape flooded with unverified AI-generated content, we believe transparency is the
          antidote. Every article on CapitalColumn links back to its primary sources, so you can always
          verify the claims we publish.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="static-section">
        <h2>How AI Is Used</h2>
        <p>Our AI-powered pipeline works in three stages:</p>
        <div class="process-steps">
          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="process-step-number">01</div>
            <div class="process-step-content">
              <h3>Source Scanning</h3>
              <p>
                AI agents continuously monitor hundreds of sources including regulatory filings,
                press releases, exchange announcements, and financial data feeds to identify
                market-moving developments.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="process-step-number">02</div>
            <div class="process-step-content">
              <h3>Article Drafting</h3>
              <p>
                Using the collected source material, our AI generates structured, factual article
                drafts. Each draft includes citations, key takeaways, and relevant financial context.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="process-step-number">03</div>
            <div class="process-step-content">
              <h3>Editorial Review</h3>
              <p>
                Published articles are reviewed for accuracy, context, and editorial standards.
                Articles clearly display their review status — whether AI-assisted, editor-reviewed,
                or source-verified.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="static-section">
        <h2>Our Standards</h2>
        <p>We hold ourselves to these principles:</p>
        <div class="standards-grid">
          <div class="standard-item">
            <div class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Source Transparency</strong>
              <p>Every article includes linked source cards so readers can verify claims independently.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-item">
            <div class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>AI Disclosure</strong>
              <p>We clearly label AI-assisted content. No hidden automation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-item">
            <div class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Correction Policy</strong>
              <p>When we get something wrong, we correct it publicly and transparently.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-item">
            <div class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>No Financial Advice</strong>
              <p>We report on markets. We do not provide investment recommendations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-item">
            <div class="standard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Independence</strong>
              <p>Our coverage is not influenced by advertisers, sponsors, or corporate partnerships.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="static-section">
        <h2>The Team</h2>
        <p>
          CapitalColumn is currently operated by the <strong>CapitalColumn Editorial Desk</strong> — a
          combination of AI agents and human editors working together to produce reliable financial
          journalism. As we grow, we plan to expand our editorial team with experienced financial
          journalists and analysts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="static-section static-section--contact">
        <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:hello@capitalcolumn.in" class="contact-link-card">
            <span class="contact-link-label">General Inquiries</span>
            <span class="contact-link-email">hello@capitalcolumn.in</span>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:corrections@capitalcolumn.in" class="contact-link-card">
            <span class="contact-link-label">Corrections & Factual Concerns</span>
            <span class="contact-link-email">corrections@capitalcolumn.in</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="static-section-cta">
          Read our full <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .static-page {
    max-width: var(--max-w-content);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-16);
  }
  .static-page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .static-page-header h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .static-page-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .static-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }
  .static-section h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .static-section p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: var(--leading-loose);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .static-section a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration-color: rgba(13, 124, 95, 0.3);
  }

  /* Process Steps */
  .process-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .process-step:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .process-step-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 40px;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .process-step-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .process-step-content p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  /* Standards Grid */
  .standards-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .standard-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .standard-item:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }
  .standard-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-light);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  .standard-item strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }
  .standard-item p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  /* Contact Links */
  .static-section--contact {
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .contact-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  .contact-link-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .contact-link-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .contact-link-label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .contact-link-email {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  }
  .static-section-cta {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .process-step {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-3);
    }
    .contact-links {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
